<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="20 22.521 140 18.958" role="img" aria-label="GEN X EVO">
<title>GEN X EVO</title>
<desc>Compact brand mark extracted verbatim from GENXEVO_WEB_HEADER_MOBILE_(DARK|LIGHT).svg — the
GENXEVO-IDENTITY-0 path, unmodified and byte-identical in both colourways. Only the viewBox was
tightened from the 390x64 mobile header mockup to the artwork bounds so the mark can be placed in a
live header. The mockup's background rect, its 1px rule and its hamburger bars are deliberately NOT
included. Filled black because this file is consumed as a CSS mask; the visible colour comes from
background-color: currentColor, so one asset serves both light and dark themes. This is the narrow
counterpart to genxevo-academy-wordmark.svg: same identity, without the ACADEMY line, for viewports
where the full lockup would crowd the navigation.</desc>
